# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The addons folder is NOT in this repo.
#
# 45 folders, 26.7 GB. Thirty-six of them are Steam Workshop items that
# re-download for free; the other nine are content that is backed up
# separately in Drive. Git is the wrong place for 26 GB of game assets, and
# on GitHub it would need a paid LFS data pack.
#
# To restore it on another machine: copy the addons folder back from Drive,
# or rebuild the Workshop half from the list in the docs. The map's local
# patch lives inside that folder too, so it comes back with it - except the
# nodegraph, which is also kept in this repo at garrysmod/maps/graphs/ so
# there is always a copy in version control.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
garrysmod/addons/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime output. Written by the server, never edited by hand. The database
# is excluded because it holds player characters and their Steam ids.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
garrysmod/sv.db
garrysmod/sv.db-wal
garrysmod/sv.db-shm
garrysmod/console.log
garrysmod/clientside_errors.txt
garrysmod/cache/
garrysmod/download/
garrysmod/downloadlists/
garrysmod/logs/
garrysmod/data/*.txt
garrysmod/data/helix/logs/
garrysmod/data/helix/falloutrp/logs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Engine files. These come from SteamCMD and re-download in minutes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/bin/
/platform/
/sourceengine/
/steamapps/
/appcache/
/depotcache/
/steam_cache/
/userdata/
/config/
/logs/
/srcds*.exe
/*.dll
/*.mdmp
garrysmod/bin/
garrysmod/*.vpk
garrysmod/fallbacks*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
